{"title":"Career Roadmap: Muralist","role":"Muralist","summary":"Career Domain: Media, Communication, Arts & Design · Qualification Pathway: BFA – Painting · Target Career: Muralist","facts":{"Current degree":"BFA (Bachelor of Fine Arts)","Course":"Painting"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Muralist paints large artworks on walls and buildings - for cities, schools, offices, homes and festivals - often working at height and in public."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Muralist does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design murals for a site and client"},{"text":"Scale up designs and prepare walls"},{"text":"Paint with brushes, rollers and spray"},{"text":"Work safely on scaffolds and lifts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Freelance mural practice"},{"text":"Street-art festivals and foundations"},{"text":"Interior and architecture firms"},{"text":"City and smart-city projects"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Assistant Muralist"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Muralist"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Lead Muralist"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Studio owner"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Public-art director"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Foundations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drawing and composition"},{"text":"Colour mixing"},{"text":"Study Indian and world mural traditions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2: Scale"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learn grid and projection scaling"},{"text":"Paint your first wall (college or community)"},{"text":"Learn wall preparation and materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3: Public work"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Assist a muralist or join a street-art festival"},{"text":"Learn spray techniques and safety"},{"text":"Document murals well"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4: Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Complete 3-5 walls for your portfolio"},{"text":"Learn quoting, contracts and permissions"},{"text":"Pitch to cafés, schools and companies"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Large-scale painting"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Wall preparation and materials"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Spray and brush techniques"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Site design"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Physical stamina"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Working in public"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exterior paints and sprays"},{"text":"Projectors"},{"text":"Procreate / Photoshop for mock-ups"},{"text":"Scaffolding (safely)"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mural studios"},{"text":"Street-art festivals"},{"text":"Interior design firms"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Working-at-height safety training"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MFA Painting / Public Art"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Entrance exams and tests to k